 ],
 "description": "The new Swift Trawler 37 Sedan is a bold step forward for BENETEAU’s popular line of passagemakers. After 140 years, we continue to innovate and have unleashed the full potential of the upper surface of this family cruiser.\nThe new space has opened a new world of possibilities which can be adapted and tailored to your unique needs on the water.",
