 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "text-images-slider",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior Design",
   "intro": "The modern Sedan configuration introduces an entirely new concept of adaptive floorspace. Whether you enjoy an active lifestyle or are seeking pure relaxation, you can set up the space to suit your needs.\nThe open platform, accessed via the inbuilt stair unit, can easily accommodate sun loungers, shading and tables for the ideal socialising space. Or for those families with an abundance of gear and toys for water and land activities, you have an easily accessible storage area.",
