   "id": null,
   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "The u-shaped galley, with a large fridge & freezer option and significant storage, is accompanied by a wide u-shaped sofa which easily seats six people and quickly converts to a double bunk with privacy curtain.\nThe raised portside forward passagemaker seat boasts a new innovation: a smart lift-up table that creates a comfortable work station adjacent to the helm.\nThe owner cabin takes priority down below and the ensuite bathroom boasts a separate shower cubicle stall.\nThe galley and bathroom feature Corian worksurfaces as standard, while the new décor and comfort Luxe pack can further enhance life on board.",
   "items": [],
