  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "Life on the water as you want it",
   "intro": "The roof of the Swift Trawler 37 Sedan has become a fully convertible living space, unleashing the full potential of the upper surface, turning it into an elegant and functional floating roof top.",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Relaxed elegance",
     "text": "Equipped with integrated electrical outlets as standard, and a shade cloth or Wood slat flooring as optional extras, this space takes on the appearance of a lounge terrace, where you can relax and look out over the horizon."
    },
    {
     "title": "Adaptability and versatility",
     "text": "This new roof top space can be customised to your own needs. You choose the furniture, accessories and configuration with your dealer, and the result is a space that is perfectly suited to how you want to enjoy life on the water."
    },
    {
     "title": "Outstanding space and comfort",
     "text": "The attractive reverse windshield extends the forepeak space above the helm. This area can easily accommodate either electric skylights or rooftop solar panels as options."
    }
   ],
